/.env.example                   Vault  Scribe   # the template whose whole job is to be safe to commit
/.github/scripts/               Vault  Forge    # secret-scan.mjs IS the key-material control
/.github/workflows/             Forge  Vault    # what actually runs the gates
/package.json                   Forge            # scripts here are the only invocation path for every gate
/eslint.config.mjs              Forge            # found by [WS-OWNED] on its first run, not by review
/supabase/tests/                Atlas  Probe    # quality/probe.md — the schema proofs


